    "detailed_description": "Have you ever wondered what it would be like to be a Mouse? Have you ever wondered what it would be like to be inside of a Maze? Wonder no more! In R.A.T.T.Z. Maze you will have to rely on the mouse to smell, and your brain to remember! <br><br>If you ever wanted to be experimented on, wait no more! R.A.T.T.Z. Maze is the control run for future testing. How fast can you finish all of the mazes? <br>How many rewards can you get? How much can you improve your runtime? Do your best, this is your control run! <br><br>Welcome to the Maze, Good luck!<br><br><br>-----------<br><br>What is this game about?<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Experiencing the simple life of a Mouse.<br></li><li>Running around in cardboard mazes.<br></li><li>Getting a reward every time you find the button.<br></li><li>Seeing how much time it took to get as far as you did last run.<br></li><li>12 starter levels to run through.</li></ul>",
